[153.09677, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mSummary\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[KI've created dupes.py, a Python CLI tool that finds duplicate files by SHA-256 content hash. Here's\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kwhat it does:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mKey features:\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mRecursive scanning\u001b[22m - walks entire directory tree with os.walk()\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mSHA-256 hashing\u001b[22m - reads files in 8KB chunks for memory efficiency\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[1mGrouped output\u001b[22m - shows duplicate sets with file count, size, and wasted space\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[1mError handling\u001b[22m - gracefully handles unreadable files\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mTest results:\u001b[22m The tool successfully identified 2 duplicate groups in the sample_files/ directory:\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mGroup 1\u001b[22m: file1.txt and file2.txt (56 bytes each) - identical content about \"first file\"\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 \u001b[1mGroup 2\u001b[22m: file4.txt and file5.txt (39 bytes each) - identical Python/SHA-256 content\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[Kfile3.txt and file6.txt remain unique\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThe tool correctly calculated 95 bytes of wasted storage from the duplicates.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2605\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8"]
